  "goodToKnow": "Kreischen means to shriek or screech, a high, shrill sound: kreischende Kinder, kreischende Möwen (gulls), kreischende Bremsen, Fans who kreischen at concerts. Schreien is to shout or scream in general. The standard forms are regular: kreischte, gekreischt; old strong forms like krisch survive only in dialect. Das Gekreische is shrieking."
